Third-party components (fetched at build time, not distributed in this repo)

Turbo Vision  -  https://github.com/magiblot/tvision
    A modern C++ port, by magiblot, of Borland's Turbo Vision.  MIT-licensed.
    Borland released the original Turbo Vision source to the public with a
    no-warranty disclaimer (see third_party/tvision/COPYRIGHT after a build).

The Find / Replace dialog builders in src/tvmail.cpp are adapted from the
`tvedit` example distributed with Turbo Vision.
